{% extends "layouts/_base.njk" %}

{% block main_content %}
  <h1>About Trail Guide</h1>

  <p>
    Trail Guide is a demo application showcasing a complete backend architecture
    built with Express, TypeScript, SQLite and Nunjucks.
  </p>

  <p>
    The website allows visitors to browse hiking trails by region while
    administrators can manage trail information through a dedicated admin
    interface.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Features</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>Browse hiking trails</li>
      <li>Explore regions</li>
      <li>REST API</li>
      <li>Admin dashboard</li>
      <li>SQLite database</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
{% endblock %}
